 Ravid, and J.A. Spudich. <year>1992</year>. Control of nonmuscle myosins by phosphorylation. <source>Annu. Rev. Biochem.</source> <volume>61</volume>:<fpage>721</fpage>&#x02013;759.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1497323</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib31"><citation citation-type="journal">Totsukawa, G., Y. Wu, Y. Sasaki, D.J. Hartshorne, Y. Yamakita, S. Yamashiro, and F. Matsumura. <year>2004</year>. Distinct roles of MLCK and ROCK in the regulation of membrane protrusions and focal adhesion dynamics during cell migration of fibroblasts. <source>J. Cell Biol.</source> <volume>164</volume>:<fpage>427</fpage>&#x02013;439.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14757754</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib32"><citation citation-type="journal">Verkhovsky, A.B., T.M. Svitkina, and G.G. Borisy. <year>1999</year>a. Network contraction model for cell translocation and retrograde flow. <source>Biochem. Soc. Symp.</source> <volume>65</volume>:<fpage>207</fpage>&#x02013;222.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10320940</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib33"><citation citation-type="journal">Verkhovsky, A.B., T.M. Svitkina, and G.G. Borisy. <year>1999</year>b. Self-polarization and directional motility of cytoplasm. <source>Curr. Biol.</source> <volume>9</volume>:<fpage>11</fpage>&#x02013;20.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9889119</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib34"><citation citation-type="journal">Vicente-Manzanares, M., J. Zareno, L. Whitmore, C.K. Choi, and A.F. Horwitz. <year>2007</year>. Regulation of protrusion, adhesion dynamics, and polarity by myosins IIA and IIB in migrating cells. <source>J. Cell Biol.</source> <volume>176</volume>:<fpage>573</fpage>&#x02013;580.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17312025</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib35"><citation citation-type="journal">Watanabe, N., and T.J. Mitchison. <year>2002</year>. Single-molecule speckle analysis of actin filament turnover in lamellipodia. <source>Science.</source> <volume>295</volume>:<fpage>1083</fpage>&#x02013;1086.<pub-i